# fixtures/phase5-packs.json. RNG-dependent outcomes are asserted on received state; exact draws go through econ-gate labels.
# Waits: delivery 10 ticks*100 ms*3 = 3 s; RPC/login policy 5 s*3 = 15 s; combat fixture allowance 30 s; protection 15 s+5.
# Role blocks (`# role: <name>`) select the pack role whose commands follow; a file without a block is role a.
# econ-gate: death_item
# econ-gate: group_chance
# econ-gate: group_select
# econ-gate: pk_gate
# econ-gate: pk_item
